#showas:安全警报
A more specialist scenario. Mainly you and two AIs, and it's set to difficulty 7.  This difficulty is good for someone who has spent some time in AI War 2.

This is on the "swirl" map type, with 100 planets. Special Forces Master AI type for both, which have much nastier Warden and Hunter Fleets, at the expense of pretty much everything else.  

Your starting fleet is set to "Cloaked," which is all about being sneaky, bypassing AI forces and hitting vital targets, as well as shooting from safety.

There are two rather different factions in here, compared to the Basic starts:

The Dark Spire have Vengeance Generators on a few planets, which absorb energy from units that die there, and uses it to warp in ships to cause havoc; if left unchecked, it can create new Generators, and be a very large problem.

The Devourer Golem is a bit different. It's always there, and does not expand in any way. Instead it roams the galaxy, looking for ships to eat. It's essentially undefeatable, so best stay away.

Both the Dark Spire and Devourer Golem are hostile to you and the AI, meaning they can be used to your advantage, if done carefully.